	// a captured environment block, which is a box with a second referent by construction. A value held at
	// an interface type is a fat pointer whose witness half is read-only data and whose value half is
	// released through `__drop_existential`, a pair the request union's payload cascade cannot carry. An
	// opaque type parameter has no layout at the send, so the sender cannot know what it is handing over.
